      "info": "A portrait of the founder works here. Used only when no image is uploaded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "origin_label",
      "label": "Origin label",
      "default": "The origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "origin_heading",
      "label": "Origin heading",
      "default": "A drinks pairing in London that never left the restaurant."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "origin_body",
      "label": "Origin body",
      "default": "<p>In 2017 Aaron Trotman was eating through Michelin-starred rooms in London. He took the alcohol pairing; the non-drinker at the table was handed something sweet and forgettable.</p><p>He had no background in drinks. He came from cosmetics chemistry, which turned out to matter more than a wine list would have. NON launched in 2019.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quote",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "I thought it was a real shame that these drinks lived and died in fancy restaurants."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quote_cite",
      "label": "Quote attribution",
      "default": "Aaron Trotman, founder"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pillars_label",
      "label": "Pillars label",
      "default": "What we actually do"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pillars_heading",
      "label": "Pillars heading",
      "default": "Every glass is built from four things"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "nots_label",
      "label": "Contrast label",
      "default": "What we're not"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text colour"
    },
